197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 138 0 R
/T (Reference articles go out of date as events develop, and updating them by hand is slow. Using a language model to automate the update rewrites text that was already correct and leaves no record of what changed. DiffusEdit instead edits the article in place. The frozen model rewrites only the stale positions, and the system repeats the process on sentences that the rewrites themselves made wrong. )
/E (Reference articles go out of date as events develop, and updating them by hand is slow. Using a language model to automate the update rewrites text that was already correct and leaves no record of what changed. DiffusEdit instead edits the article in place. The frozen model rewrites only the stale positions, and the system repeats the process on sentences that the rewrites themselves made wrong. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
